    {
      "chapter": "Restore the complete assembly",
      "duration_ms": 3000,
      "note": "The rotor, guard and hardware are visible again, with the original joint positions restored. Fit, bearing drag and electrical output still need physical testing."
    },
    {
      "chapter": "One editable print plate per part",
      "duration_ms": 3000,
      "note": "Each plate shows one actual occurrence in its bed pose and exports that occurrence as 3MF. Print the stage plate twice. Hardware and other components remain editable but hidden. The complete assembly is restored before drawings and final checks; qualify toolpaths and measured fits before use."
    },
