    {
      "call": {
        "arguments": {
          "position": [
            22.0,
            207.0
          ],
          "sheet_id": {
            "$ref": "bom_sheet_id"
          },
          "text": "Purchased fasteners have native installed envelopes. The two complete 608ZZ bearings include\nthe separately modeled inner rings and shields; the generator includes its shaft. Verify\nactual head, nut and shaft dimensions before purchase/printing. PETG baseline. Fits, motor\nprojection, hub slip, rotor startup, bearing clamp load and guard access require physical\nqualification. Ages8-12 with adult guidance; age5 only with closer hands-on adult guidance."
        },
